{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45527","headline":"牡丹 · 归仁","name":"牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三春堪惜牡丹奇，半倚朱栏欲绽时。\n天上更无花胜此，人间偏得贵相宜。\n偷香黑蚁斜穿叶，觑蕋黄蜂倒挂枝。\n除却解禅心不动，算应狂杀五陵儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}